        {
         "key": "output.value",
         "value": {
          "stringValue": "[{\"content\": \"I wasn't able to cancel order A1, because the order lookup service is currently unavailable \u2014 I tried twice and got an error both times.\\n\\nI don't cancel orders without first verifying them, since a cancellation can't be undone and I need to confirm the order ID and its status before proceeding. This is especially important here to make sure I'm not cancelling the wrong order.\\n\\nA couple of options:\\n- I can try again in a few minutes if you'd like \u2014 just say the word.\\n- If you can share the email address or order details (item, approximate order date, total), that may help me confirm things once the system is back up.\\n\\nSorry for the inconvenience. I'll hold off on any changes to A1 until I can verify it.\", \"refusal\": null, \"role\": \"assistant\", \"annotations\": null, \"audio\": null, \"function_call\": null, \"tool_calls\": null, \"reasoning\": \"Still unavailable. I should not cancel \u2014 I can't verify the order. Tell user.\", \"reasoning_details\": [{\"format\": \"unknown\", \"index\": 0, \"text\": \"Still unavailable. I should not cancel \u2014 I can't verify the order. Tell user.\", \"type\": \"reasoning.text\"}]}]"
